# Collision Course counts "permanents you control that are creatures and/or Vehicles", each permanent once (CR 301.7, 120.3): on
# turn 3 Bot1 crews Reckoner Bankbuster with Savannah Lions and Zephyr Sprite (CR 702.122a), so the crewed Vehicle is a creature
# and a Vehicle, and X is 3 (Lions, Sprite, Bankbuster), not 4: Bot2's Aegis Turtle is left with 3 damage. On turn 5 the second
# mode, "Destroy target artifact", refuses that Turtle (not an artifact) and destroys Bot2's Air Response Unit.

